                       MOVE 9 TO WS-PREMIUM-BAND
               END-EVALUATE.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       NORMALISE-WITH-PROFITS-0047.
               UNSTRING WS-KEY-CHAR DELIMITED BY '/'
                             INTO WS-KEY-CUSTOMER
                                  WS-KEY-POLICY
               END-UNSTRING.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       NORMALISE-WITH-PROFITS-0048.
